  triage:triagedAt "2026-09-12T22:19:10Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:deferredNote "Fix: add a Phase-BB amendment note under the existing Phase-BA amendment (after line 2918) and correct the active/Started cell to state the reject-with-ATM_TASK_ALREADY_ACTIVE contract, mirroring ADR-062's corrected wording (see BB4-005). Owner named by quality-mgr: solar (fix round R2, same worktree stack). Not routed; Phase BB is cancelled and the code now lives on feature/bb-collapsed (PR #1452). Nothing to record or dispatch until Rand decides the BB.5 disposition." ;
